{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Cart Budget Calculator 是一款在購物途中緊盯預算的工具，適合經常逛超市、添置家庭用品或挑選禮物的人。用家只需設定購物預算，再逐項輸入放入購物車的貨品價格，畫面便會即時顯示還剩下多少錢。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-134.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>即時顯示剩餘購物預算</h2>\n<p>設定購物預算後，把貨品加入購物車時只需輸入價格，應用便會自動扣減並更新剩餘金額，讓你即時判斷下一件貨品是否仍在預算之內。無論超市買菜、添置家居用品或選購禮物都合用。程式毋須連接銀行，也不記錄開支歷史，只專注呈現結帳前最需要知道的那個數字。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-137-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-138-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-139-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-140-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-141-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Cart Budget Calculator</li><li>應用類別：Shopping</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/cart-budget-calculator/id6802814389?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T04:41:24.135706+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":313,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T04:31:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T04:38:30.318488+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T04:38:30.318488+00:00","content_hash":"b34b62c98eb4dfc10e0851f354c05c8e473882a9f197ddb358f43c242ff9fb35","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}